// Drink: raising the estus flask to the visor and drinking, 60 ticks,
// the default flask_ticks (docs/architecture.md section 11, "模型和动画"):
// lifting 0-30, then (after the heal on the default flask_heal_tick 30)
// drinking and lowering 30-60. The game stretches each part on its own.
// Rotations are YXZ degrees about each bone's position along the model's
// axes (+X right, +Y up, -Z forward); see assets/anims/README.md for which
// way each bone turns.
//
// The flask is a node hung on hand_l (section 19, "挂在骨骼上"). Tick 0:
// standing. 10, 20: the left hand bringing the flask up. 30: the flask's
// mouth right in front of the visor slit. 38, 45: head tipped back,
// the flask tipped to the mouth. 52: lowering. 60: standing. The sword
// hangs at the right side all along.
// Flask mouth (m) by key: 10: [-0.288, 1.221, -0.335], 20: [-0.094, 1.569, -0.398], 30: [0.028, 1.733, -0.225], 38: [0.013, 1.716, -0.227], 45: [0.008, 1.733, -0.212], 52: [-0.19, 1.367, -0.406].
